{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-07",
  "title": "Reunion Under Fire",
  "storyCode": "12-8",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7687608acbf27d7fb105b8508d7b61ff64db44308f2ddf6fa23e1f83038e4381",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "It's really changed around here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "Ruins, corpses, and Originium dust floating from the dead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "text": "I imagine you Rhodes Islanders don't need me worrying about your protection, being Oripathy specialists and all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This war has been creating new Infected without end... and life under these circumstances can only make it harder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "They've been thrown into this chaos without warning, and they may not realize how cruel a fall it is yet. That goes for the pain of their illness, and the scars of war...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "But they'll know soon enough, and twice over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "We all have a clear picture of how it infects and festers, how the people die in their confusion, or amass in their hatred.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "text": "And you've seen where that hatred leads, Doctor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Reunion.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "War's given people a great excuse. Without the veil of daily life, things could get even worse.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Whatever reason it is, we need to stop Theresis.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...And Theresa.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "...Roger.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "It looks like we'll have to part ways for the moment. So goes our line of work—always piles of things nagging at you to deal with them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Right. I think I'll be seeing you in a bit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Stay productive, now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Bleeding hell, he... he makes my hairs stand on end.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Not even old PC Whitman ever made me feel so sick.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Alright, everyone, chin up. Welcome to the HQ of we merry Glasgow Gangers. I mean, I can guarantee it WAS at least.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Don't know how Baird's been running the gym since we left...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Siege, Morgan, you not got anything to say?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "Indra, love... I think I stepped on something...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Eh? Probably just someone's pet scarpering for the street aga...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "The hell is... is that a...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Amiya, don't look.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I've seen already, Doctor. In those illusions from the past, I've seen sights still more tragic than the ones here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We're here precisely to ensure the situation doesn't unfold that far.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "The hatted man led us here, then permitted us to act freely on our own wishes outside of the deal we made. His goal is clear to us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "He knows we won't be content with letting all this be, and he hopes the people here will credit the Duke he serves with our actions.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But I don't care.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I don't care how the Duke wants to use us. I don't care what kind of prestige she's hoping to rake in.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I don't care if this will impact some other duke's fight for their people's affections, or compel them to act in whatever way.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "All that matters is I cannot let this be.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "This isn't some disaster taking place in a country, in a city, in a neighborhood unrelated to us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "This is happening to each and every living person.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Trust has always been a fragile thing, collapsed in a moment, ever harder to rebuild.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Quickly, Doctor. We might not have that many pharmaceuticals on us, but we have to make all the use of them that we can.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "There, that should be okay now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Sorry, I'm not a professional doctor. This is just some basic first-aid.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We've stabilized your Oripathy symptoms, and stopped your wounds worsening. That's all we can do for now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You need rest, and supplements. After that, it's down to luck.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Do you need us to bring you home?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "No, no, no need!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "Hunger knocked me out, that's all. Just, was sleeping for a bit on the pavement.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "What... What'll you be wanting? I've got nothing to my name.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We don't want anything.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "N... Nothing?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Go back home, sir.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "(Here's some food. Keep it hidden. Don't let anyone else find out.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "Wh—Who the...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "Alright, alright. I'll be out of here, then...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "(You've gone too long without food. Don't eat too quickly. You need to let your bodily functions recover bit by bit first.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "Right, got it...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Maimed Citizen",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Amiya, we have a lot of people staring at us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Most of them with ill will.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Two groups are planning their moves and readying Molotovs.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I know.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But at the same time, the desperate have seen us too. And the ones hiding themselves in the dark, deathly ill, so have they.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Just the fact we're here might have been enough to relight a spark of hope in them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "After a violent collapse, any rebuild demands great care.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "That's right, Doctor.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We don't need for the people to trust us, we need them to... reestablish their trust in each other.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "That's what underlies a society coming back to life.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Someone's coming.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Doesn't matter. I'm stood right here. I'll stand in front of you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "This is our street, and we're pulling her back out of this chaos and anger.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "Doesn't matter who it is. Bring it on.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "Mind yourselves. Here they come.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "Hey!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Is that—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "(Oi, watch you don't fuss about nothing, Hannah. Nearly socked you straight in the gob.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "(You lot show off like a circus. You want everyone here targeting you?)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "(Come on. With me.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Starving Thug",
          "text": "They're gonna run!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "Shit! The Glasgows got in first!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Starving Thug",
          "text": "Surround 'em!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Out of the way.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Ms. Ines, don't take them on. Not for now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I... recognize a few of their lot. It's just the fear and torture's driving them mad.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Nothing they need to pay for with their lives.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "(Head to the alley we used to bunk off at for snooker. Same door as ever.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "(Got it.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "(Baird, we'll... see you at home.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Come with me!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "Quick! Get a move on, don't lose 'em!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Starving Thug",
          "text": "I... I haven't eaten for days, I can't run...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "On your bike and get out of here, then! You'd eat dead people if you had any spine! I'm not your nanny!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "You wanna go?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "Who are those people?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "Eh? Who else are they gonna be? It's the Glasgow bastards!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "The Glasgow Gang, are they.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Angry Thug",
          "text": "Are we getting them together, or am I getting you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "No, I reckon I've seen them before. And that one in the uniform...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "Things here got more complex than I was predicting.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Red",
          "text": "I need to move fast.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Is there a bigger ruckus in there today or something? Did a fire start again?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "Should I go take a look, sir?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "If a fire spreads...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Then it's no skin off your nose, little girl.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Do your own job. Don't let me see anything funny.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "No one's going to look out for you here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "A... Aye-aye, sir!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Sir! What brings you here in person?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "There's nothing you need to worry about here, it's all under control!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Paying no heed to the Sarkaz soldier's report, Manfred walks over to the foot of the blockade zone's wall, gazing far off at the buildings within."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Is... Is something off, sir?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "The war continues to proceed smoothly.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "Paprika, what have you witnessed in these past days?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "They've just been—slaughtering each other.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "No, it's not even that, really... they've just been... so scared.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "Fear and mistrust divide a people. Pacts, customs and morals all collapse forthwith under extreme conditions.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "The Kazdel of old attested to that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "Kazdel...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "Hence do our two leaders take a stand.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "You mean...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "What if I were to ask you—what can bind a people?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "Maybe... patience? We can try and win people over, or use our own kindness to move others...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "I think, as long as you have enough time...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "She failed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "Any ties that such things build are too frail.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "But he told me. The most efficient thing... is hate.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Manfred throws an indifferent glance at the young mercenary girl, her breaths bound tight by nerves, daring only to stare at the tips of her own shoes."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "You have persistently been sharing your own supplies with those behind the blockade.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "N—No! That was a Sarkaz! I thought...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "What?! How could you—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Sarkaz who serve Victoria should make you even more sick!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "Sir, I assure you, I will immediately...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "Continue.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Soldier",
          "text": "...Sir?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "We cannot have everyone inside dying of starvation yet.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "text": "In time... they will be of great use to the Military Commission.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Not much has changed around here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Morgan, all your graffiti's still up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "I'm looking now. My standards must have been terrible back then.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "You haven't got much better, though?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "text": "Oh, you wanna go, Hannah?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "As the two argue, Siege and Baird look on, then make brief eye contact, and break into laughter, shaking their heads.\nIf you overlook the sealed-up entrance, the boarded-up windows and the weariness in their expressions, it might all seem like nothing's changed.\nBut everyone knows deep inside. 'We haven't changed' is self-consolation at most, a kind of illusion.\nEvery minute and second that's ever passed has left an unquestionable mark on them."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Long time no see, Baird.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "True that, Vina. Long time no see.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "The fact you're still around and kicking is probably the best news I've had in a long while.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "I've never said die, you know that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "That I do.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "Vina, I'm... just as happy to see you back here. Happier than you could imagine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "I always believed you'd come back. We put up the sign for the Slobberknocker together and all, back in the early days.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "Just, it's been hard for me to grin and bear it. In these times.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I know.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "And I know you didn't come back just for my sakes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "Five whole years ago you scrambled out of here... I remember Norport was practically open season already, all those bastards after your neck.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I... wasn't ready then.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I didn't want to tow anyone else into my business. It was leave or nothing.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "So? You're back here now, back on our street. Now you're ready.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "...I hope I am.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "The Rhodes Islanders want to look for that Sarkaz airship here. I'll be assisting them as a Rhodes operator and all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "But I've never stopped being a member of the Glasgow Gang.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I'll get you out of this mess. That's my duty to you. Always has been.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "Hah, same as ever, you are, Vina. Not one bit different.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Hah. Just like it used to be, eh.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "Just, there's one thing. I don't know if...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Baird",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "text": "Baird, we're skint on supplies as is. Now you bring in all these people.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "text": "You want everyone to split up once we're done eating? Or are you hoping I'll go rob some blockhouse with security up to here?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "text": "Shut it with that, Cador.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "text": "Although our stockpile's definitely...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Please, it's okay. We've brought rations with us. We even have some surplus.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Delphine",
          "text": "Hmm. Not... the biggest amount, but enough to put us out of dire straits for now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We can change this zone together.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "As long as we can unite everyone on the plate...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "text": "Pff. Unite?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "text": "Listen, Cautus runt, 'unite' is an easy word to toss around. But you lot are more than welcome to try.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cador",
          "text": "Fingers crossed... you're what makes the difference.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
